        <mxCell id="21" value="E se a referência continuasse ausente? O worker reagenda com backoff 2 s · 2ⁿ (teto 5 min); após 15 tentativas (≈ 43 min) o estorno&lt;br&gt;vira REJECTED / REFERENCE_NOT_FOUND e sai o evento WagerTransactionRejected, para o provedor reenviar." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=11;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;dashed=1;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="902" width="1160" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
